{"4398500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Broke Wizards", "steam_appid": 4398500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5086300], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <strong>Scribblenauts</strong> comes a new  1-6 player co-op game where you and your Wizard roommates slay monsters, go racing, play prop hunt or do other crazy jobs to pay rent to a giant Imp Landlord before he eats you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GIG WORK FOR WIZARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From saving towns to exploring the backrooms to racing magical ravens to playing every wizard's favorite snake clone on your phone: Slitherin'! The world is full of unique jobs to take on. Some pay well. Others are quick and easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/92572bed1ed8b6423429aa792765b759.poster.avif?t=1787771716\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/92572bed1ed8b6423429aa792765b759.webm?t=1787771716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/92572bed1ed8b6423429aa792765b759.mp4?t=1787771716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMBAT </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These Wizards aren't just powerful... they're OP! Save towns by killing monsters, just don't wreck the neighborhood by destroying buildings in the process, or you won't get paid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/30c045b28d49e7481f544fe7c027bdc2.poster.avif?t=1787771716\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/30c045b28d49e7481f544fe7c027bdc2.webm?t=1787771716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/30c045b28d49e7481f544fe7c027bdc2.mp4?t=1787771716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VIBE OUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rent isn't due until the end of the week, so kick back together and watch videos, jam on instruments, play tag, PvP in the player arena, set off some fireworks. Sometimes slacking off is the point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR WIZARDS  </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try on new hoodies, unlock new magic boards, craft some hats or wings to equip. Or find and hatch some Pocketdragon eggs to add a buddy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/46ee8e309f294af336ddc25bd5bc92ce.poster.avif?t=1787771716\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/46ee8e309f294af336ddc25bd5bc92ce.webm?t=1787771716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/46ee8e309f294af336ddc25bd5bc92ce.mp4?t=1787771716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EARN MAGIC KEYS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you do earns Magic Keys: exploring, jobs, puzzles, even paying rent. Collect them all to open the treasure chest holding your deed and be rid of your Imp Landlord for good!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/090d8fdee796ddcdc65d1cdd4676aeae.apng?t=1787771716\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/090d8fdee796ddcdc65d1cdd4676aeae.poster.avif?t=1787771716\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/1e5bba90cf1a82c9c09c8e22eb8000d6.apng?t=1787771716\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/1e5bba90cf1a82c9c09c8e22eb8000d6.poster.avif?t=1787771716\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/df00da161605366f8ca536718b0181fa.apng?t=1787771716\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/df00da161605366f8ca536718b0181fa.poster.avif?t=1787771716\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/12bf1b414a2c581213c92ac6ddcc586f.apng?t=1787771716\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/12bf1b414a2c581213c92ac6ddcc586f.poster.avif?t=1787771716\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/115cc275307aa61ece784e46f3a9ab79.apng?t=1787771716\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/115cc275307aa61ece784e46f3a9ab79.poster.avif?t=1787771716\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/b03f99bacd5bc02e4501d7948d037a82.apng?t=1787771716\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/b03f99bacd5bc02e4501d7948d037a82.poster.avif?t=1787771716\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Co-Op with up to 6 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Tons of Mini-Games to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Focus on progress or just slack off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* In-Game Voice Chat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Secrets to unlock and Mysteries to solve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Character Customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Offline Single Player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Lobbies for Public and Private Games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Difficulty Settings</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <strong>Scribblenauts</strong> comes a new  1-6 player co-op game where you and your Wizard roommates slay monsters, go racing, play prop hunt or do other crazy jobs to pay rent to a giant Imp Landlord before he eats you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GIG WORK FOR WIZARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From saving towns to exploring the backrooms to racing magical ravens to playing every wizard's favorite snake clone on your phone: Slitherin'! The world is full of unique jobs to take on. Some pay well. Others are quick and easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/92572bed1ed8b6423429aa792765b759.poster.avif?t=1787771716\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398500/extras/92572bed1ed8b6423429aa792765